{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b66683a142049a3dbcfb72b23c30a56c5a219d75219daa9331d5434081b38fbb", "ja": "お疲れさま、まつり。\nウェディングドレスの撮影、華やかだったな。", "zh": "辛苦你了，茉莉。\n婚纱拍得很漂亮喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "8b84db1e3ffc9879acb4c140e0795343e0f53f7d1b366898188a1f03afaf3d26", "ja": "お疲れさまなのです、{$P$}さん。\nとっても綺麗なドレスで、姫は大満足だったのです♪", "zh": "辛苦你了喔，{$P$}先生。\n礼服非常美丽，公主十分满足的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "295c7375db42a5ada1f38114cada3f0a225964a65b5e210db4cb602fe2645ec6", "ja": "ウェディングドレスを着た姫の魅力……\n{$P$}さんにも、伝わりましたか？", "zh": "公主穿上婚纱后的魅力……\n{$P$}先生，你有感受到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f6036ab2b43924db08d3d26397a3a74f93ce8b82c830115162992f95412ef011", "ja": "ああ、すごく綺麗だったよ。白馬の王子様が、\n列を作って求婚するんじゃないか？", "zh": "有啊，真的非常漂亮。\n应该会有许多白马王子排队等着向你求婚吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "f46941b9c1bd7e0893d5485503040aebda020b58bd6cd8fe09270d789bc0fee7", "ja": "ほ？　王子様の列？", "zh": "哦？许多白马王子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1005_p", "source_sha256": "392e095db59f44bac0f191f09b0fa9582634b8fe0794b05435a35021cae1239e", "ja": "ん？　……あれ？\nまつりの理想は、白馬の王子様じゃなかったっけ……？", "zh": "嗯？奇怪……？\n茉莉，你的理想条件不就是白马王子吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "9665fee6da2e35c6ae94eefa0f9e2050ceff9ec97c0b70e03cf19a608a31a723", "ja": "もちろん、姫は姫なのです。でも違うのです。\n白馬の王子様には、厳しい条件があるのですよ。", "zh": "当然啰，因为公主是公主嘛，不过不是那样的。\n要当上白马王子，条件可是很严格的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7a4f75bbf93adf7279100ae293f04380045deb2d7f03e04dbaeed85983e79d96", "ja": "厳しい条件……？", "zh": "条件很严格……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "e1c71dd8505d3636b7b89e38e9d85ac5aa1653e117a296d0a3e87dbbb4ceb425", "ja": "そうなのです！　{$P$}さん、\nちっともわかってないのですね？", "zh": "没错喔！\n{$P$}先生，你完全不懂，对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "188ec59fda9339ff1810c3a9eed797070243c330885d37920dd31af604c61703", "ja": "それでは姫が、{$P$}さんが\n白馬の王子様になれるよう、指導してあげましょー！", "zh": "那么就由公主来指导{$P$}先生，\n让你能成为白马王子吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a5004a484a10485c8b1c4d14d4049dcf2bbee7131c6a5250e1624777e63dc005", "ja": "え？　いや、俺は別に……\nうわあああああ！！？", "zh": "咦？不用了，我并不打算……\n呜哇啊啊啊啊啊！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "70b48115585470549cc0bccab080aaa7aeac0421ea26408b9d6c8f189b37851d", "ja": "と、いうわけなのです！\nわかりましたか？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "就是这么一回事的喔！\n你了解了吗？{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1012_p", "source_sha256": "66aac4cbc8204f4f5c7e957c97e75d6c61a476b69bc83ee7a38f4ccbe5abfd70", "ja": "い、色々な条件があるんだな、白馬の王子には……。\nというか、ずいぶんハードルが高いような……。", "zh": "原、原来要成为白马王子，还有这么多条件……\n应该说，感觉门槛非常高……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "d6f3bfbbeeed00bd8e9e5d2a3d883f3ab5ce7c5b1530a3f1a6d19bc5f6c608a4", "ja": "そうなのです。だから白馬の王子様は、\n大勢はいらないのです。", "zh": "没错喔，所以公主不需要\n那么多白马王子排队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "2e1362b222f567db944f65e9f0822e30afabaf7823adf7845dd0d5c0739d6657", "ja": "お姫さまがたったひとりなのと同じように。\n白馬の王子様も、たったひとり、なのですよ？", "zh": "公主只有一个人，\n同样的，白马王子也只会有一位喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7b290ecf3f09ec0e98edadf196cd3364e52fbf80d8df3cf56d580f00eb769cea", "ja": "うん……確かにそうだな。\n白馬の王子は、選ばれし精鋭なのかもしれない……。", "zh": "嗯……你说得对。\n白马王子或许是万中选一的精锐呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "1e811bd019c7e1f0d12f925c9fafc091e96a7056d2a4844a4fdc6b479e9a2db4", "ja": "そういうことなのです。だから姫の白馬の王子様も、\n姫のことをたくさん知っていてほしいのです♪", "zh": "就是这样的喔，所以公主希望，\n白马王子可以对公主有更多认识♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1017_p", "source_sha256": "572ea10bb5d520e3b41c077299e6e48720a9df930f95c68924ce2196795ef804", "ja": "そうか。まつりも、いつか出会えるといいな。\nそんな相手に。", "zh": "这样啊……希望茉莉有一天\n能够遇到那样的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "dfc6388ee39aa01a9fc2055ae6207ceb95cf6e4ddfa4efe3859b95f3040f6766", "ja": "はいほー！　もちろんなのです♪\nでも、一番大事な王子様の条件は……。", "zh": "Hi Ho～！那是当然的喔♪\n不过，王子最重要的条件……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0093_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "3b7c2d43262aa6d73a6a1dc7eeff130263bd357c1a013373a867686eec3cc741", "ja": "いつも私の隣にいてくれること、なんだよ？", "zh": "就是随时都能陪在我身边喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
